<title>MOROCCO: Fewer killed on Morocco's roads in 1996.</title>
<headline>Fewer killed on Morocco's roads in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan road deaths fell 19.02 percent in 1996 to 2,563 dead from 3,165 in 1995, the official MAP news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>This was due mainly to a more than five percent decrease in the number of accidents, which totalled 36,179 in 1996 compared to 38,200 in 1995, said MAP.</p>
